    "created_at": "2015-11-13T14:37:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-13T14:37:10Z",
    "body": "If we're creating a new top-level browsing context, I'd suggest that we shouldn't inherit this state.\n\nIf we're creating a nested or auxiliary browsing context, inheriting the various bits of state for `about:blank` makes sense.\n",
